From: Gaudi port <gaudi-port@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 19:44:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Qwen4Exp HPU port for Qwen3.8-Flash-Next

Out-of-tree vllm-gaudi support for qwen4_exp: GDN + dense attention fallback,
PLE n-gram layer, gathered-expert FP8 MoE, sampling-metadata cache, and
256-candidate top-k/top-p. Applies to vllm-gaudi 2dd55f97 (releases/v0.29.0)
with stock vLLM 98dff2a8 (no vLLM tree edits).
