+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+"""HPU implementation of Qwen4Exp (Qwen3.8-Flash-Next).
+
+Upstream vLLM ships a CUDA/ROCm-only implementation (Triton hyper-connection
+kernels, FlashAttention-based sparse QSA attention, Triton PLE kernels, CUDA
+top-k ops).  This module re-implements the model with pure PyTorch on top of
+the plugin's existing HPU building blocks:
+
+* linear-attention layers  -> ``HPUGatedDeltaNetAttention`` (same layout as Qwen3.5)
+* full-attention layers    -> ``Qwen3NextAttention`` + HPU paged attention.
+                              The Qwen Sparse Attention (QSA) indexer selects
+                              the top ``indexer_budget`` (=2048) tokens; for
+                              contexts up to that budget dense attention is
+                              mathematically identical.  Beyond the budget we
+                              currently run dense attention (documented
+                              approximation, see docs/).
+* hyper-connections        -> upstream pure-torch ``GatedResidual``
+* PLE n-gram layer         -> HPU-native lookup table (uint8 storage + LUT
+                              dequant), int32 bit-exact hashing, dilated
+                              depthwise conv with per-request state kept in
+                              the hybrid Mamba cache (compact GDN slots).
+* MoE                      -> ``Qwen3NextSparseMoeBlock`` (HPU fused MoE, FP8).
+"""
